cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated paper
  (preferred-citation below) and, optionally, this repository itself.
type: software
title: "Hydrological Phase Analysis of Gauge Series"
abstract: >-
  A Jupyter notebook that classifies daily gauge (water-level) series into
  hydrological phases (Low, Rising, High, Falling) and produces per-river
  station panels, a seasonality overview, and station-summary figures and
  tables. Developed to support the gauge-side hydrological-phase labelling
  used in the associated SWOT validation paper (preferred-citation below).
authors:
